9
00:00:25,877 --> 00:00:31,377
(Sheldon:)Actually, I have a plastic baggy
strapped to my leg that says I can.

10
00:00:33,185 --> 00:00:34,315
(Sheldon:)Give up, Wolowitz.

11
00:00:34,519 --> 00:00:38,049
(Sheldon:)You've chosen to tangle
with a superior intellect you can't defeat.

