00:00:38,256 --> 00:00:39,916
(Sheldon:)There is nothing
you could possibly do to...

13
00:00:49,434 --> 00:00:51,164
(Howard:)Those aren't gonna help you, Sheldon.

14
00:00:51,369 --> 00:00:55,019
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes, they are. I mean, what?

